{"title": "Highcliff's Blueprints", "pageid": 8093, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Highcliff's_Blueprints", "categories": ["Notes", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Parchment_C_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Book_Parchment_C_Faded.png/300px-Book_Parchment_C_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/4/44/Book_Parchment_C_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Highcliff's Blueprints image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Book_Parchment_C_Faded.png/300px-Book_Parchment_C_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Book_Parchment_C_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Highcliff's Blueprints</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Story_Item\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Story Item\">Story-related</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Book</a>. Reading it will add, or update, a journal entry relating to the <a href=\"/wiki/Finish_the_Masterwork_Weapon\" title=\"Finish the Masterwork Weapon\">Finish the Masterwork Weapon</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Quest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quest\">Quest</a>. Passing a <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Skill Check</a> will give further information on where to find <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Tree_Bark\" title=\"Sussur Tree Bark\">Sussur Tree Bark</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span 