</a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_FOR_MasterworkPlans</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_FOR_MasterworkPlans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_FOR_MasterworkPlans\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">08712231-9c7c-4a83-8125-289a419e210f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:08712231-9c7c-4a83-8125-289a419e210f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:08712231-9c7c-4a83-8125-289a419e210f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a wooden chest in the basement of a house in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>, around. <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-438&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-378</span>. Watch for traps nearby.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Precise arcs and neatly drawn lines form the blueprints of three weapons: a greatsword, a sickle and a dagger. Each length and angle is marked with exact measurements, and forging instructions are printed carefully along the bottom of the page, emphasisisng an unusual ingredient: sussur bark. The sussur bark can only be applied to an ordinary, unmodified blade.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1697/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30408/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8544/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931944/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.592      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   50.592      1 -total\n 51.72%   26.168      7 Template:Icon_text\n 46.66%   23.608     19 Template:Trim\n 21.65%   10.955      2 Template:Uid\n 16.46%    8.329      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.33%    6.744      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.25%    6.703      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.18%    6.160      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.13%    6.135      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8093-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195915 and revision id 387116. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}